\p{\code{\verb~|rrc~}, the clang-style pipeline driver over the stage chain \code{\verb~|.rr → hir → mir → mlir → LLVM IR → objects/executables~}, re-entrant at every dump; machine-target selection (\code{\verb~|--target-triple~}, \code{\verb~|--target-cpu~}, \code{\verb~|--target-features~}) including \code{\verb~|wasm32-wasip1[-threads]~}.}

\p{Landed in \pr{486}.}
